"**Vertical margins** and **Horizontal margins**: the blank space around the "
"labels, on the edges of the sheet,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:254
msgid ""
"**Vertical spacing** and **Horizontal spacing**: the blank space between two "
"labels,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:255
msgid "**Label width** and **Label height**: the size of one label,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:256
msgid ""
"**Number of label columns** and **Number of label lines**: how many labels a "
"sheet holds,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:257
msgid "**Font size**: the size of the text printed on the labels,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:258
msgid ""
"**Print border**: print a grey border around each label, handy for a first "
"try on plain paper."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:260
msgid "The values usually are written on the box of the labels."
