#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:263
msgid "Cards"
msgstr "Cartões"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:265
msgid "Galette settings, cards tab"
msgstr "Definições do Galette, separador de cartões"

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:270
msgid "This tab sets the content and the look of the member cards:"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:272
msgid ""
"**Short Text (Card Center)**: a short text printed in the middle of the "
"card, 10 characters at most; the acronym of your association for example,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:273
msgid ""
"**Long Text (Bottom Line)**: a text printed at the bottom of the card, 65 "
"characters at most,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:274
msgid ""
"**Strip Text Color**: the color of the text written on the bottom strip,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:275
msgid ""
"**Active Member Color**, **Board Members Color** and **Honor Members "
"Color**: the color of the main texts and of the bottom strip, depending on "
"the status of the member; the honor color is used for benefactor and founder "
"members,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:276
msgid ""
"**Logo**: a logo for printing, if the one of the association does not suit,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:277
msgid ""
"**Allow members to print card ?**: members can download their own card, as "
"long as their membership is up to date,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:278
msgid "**Show title ?**: print the title (Mr., Mrs....) in front of the name,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:279
msgid ""
"**Address type**: what is printed under the name: email, zip code and town, "
"nickname, profession or member number,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:280
msgid ""
"**Year**: the year printed on the card. It can be a year, two years "
"separated with a slash (*2026/2027*), or ``DEADLINE`` to print the end of "
"membership of each member,"
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:281
msgid ""
"margins, spacing, width and height of the cards on the page, in millimeters."
msgstr ""

#: ../usermanual/preferences.rst:283
